{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0623_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0623_1000_p", "source_sha256": "bba6548caa192f2bd8223c16f4b1bc8f217b90488c4a5a37daed97c4c394c27a", "ja": "（コスプレグラビア企画のコラボで、百合子は子ども\n向け番組で、ウサギのマスコットに挑むことになった）", "zh": "（作为角色扮演写真企划的合作项目，百合子要在儿童节目中挑战兔子吉祥物的扮演）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0623_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0623_1001_026yur", "source_sha256": "f547563de1418f009b9885d3934546d3df91de89d4db9a4ad150079d4dff9a13", "ja": "{$P$}さん、\n読み聞かせコーナーの本は、これで大丈夫でしょうか？", "zh": "{$P$}先生，\n讲故事环节用的书，选这本可以吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0623_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0623_1002_p", "source_sha256": "ac74b3bde4ca3e1b8bd7aad7682df03fecb5cb97051552169cfa6793511748f0", "ja": "ああ、大丈夫だよ。百合子がいろいろ考えて\n悩んで選んだものなんだ。自信をもっていい。", "zh": "啊，没问题。这是百合子经过一番思考和纠结后选出来的书。你可以对自己有信心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0623_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0623_1003_026yur", "source_sha256": "7e2066bfdb44a9bbe5e9764692c4b2224ba3ee056d36616fe10316731b072fff", "ja": "でも今日は、いろんな年齢の子がいるんですよね？\nちょっと、小さい子向けにしすぎた気が……。", "zh": "不过今天有各种年龄段的孩子在，对吧？\n我觉得好像有点太偏向年幼的孩子了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0623_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0623_1004_026yur", "source_sha256": "5a8216ea0357062ed73c316ee1a46bc76b61cbab96a75c135035a663f571b313", "ja": "だって……『ぼくたちはともだち！\nずっとウサギさんといっしょ！』って児童書ですよ？", "zh": "因为……这不是儿童读物《我们是朋友！一直和小兔子在一起！》吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0623_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0623_1005_026yur", "source_sha256": "a89fbe70825d4c431010ca5071db0a084ff39d1acd0d1b7ed5795d6379f94f26", "ja": "でもでも！　本当にいい本なのは間違いないです！\n読み聞かせのイベントでも、すごく人気があるとか。", "zh": "不过不过！这本书确实是本很棒的书！\n听说在故事朗读活动上也非常受欢迎。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0623_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0623_1006_026yur", "source_sha256": "36ac8ac6cd5e4d74042064f3397cae1204fe0f4c949115fc5571c102981b31bd", "ja": "何度読んでも、新鮮な驚きと感動があって、味わい深い\nですし、分かりやすくお話もまとめられていて……。", "zh": "不管读多少遍，都会有新鲜的惊喜和感动，令人回味无穷，而且故事也讲得很清楚……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0623_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0623_1007_p", "source_sha256": "87721cd87e469b8cd352430760c93c32e3101942def1d7384ca625565fbef53e", "ja": "うん、そうだな。\n俺も読んだけど、いいお話だと思ったよ。", "zh": "嗯，确实呢。\n我也读了，觉得是个很棒的故事哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0623_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0623_1008_p", "source_sha256": "99581ccb8dc556f31ec834eabac3caef20aa5aadde6e53acfe52945bfd43b611", "ja": "俺もちょっと感動したからな。いいお話は、\n何歳になっても、心に響くんだと思うよ。", "zh": "我也有点感动了。好的故事，无论到了多大年纪，都会触动心灵吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0623_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0623_1009_026yur", "source_sha256": "a443728a8175b991932eba7c1377a7feb90b5c05a89ee687339a5281a0ed75e9", "ja": "{$P$}さん……。", "zh": "{$P$}先生……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0623_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0623_1010_p", "source_sha256": "386f0ff90f842b2c71ceded06c625ae2d46a6a8d4833bf30626232efa35a8b77", "ja": "それに今こそ、物語の伝道師の出番じゃないか？\nこの本の魅力を伝えられるのは、百合子しかいない。", "zh": "而且，现在不正是故事传道师登场的时候吗？\n能传达出这本书魅力的，只有百合子。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0623_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0623_1011_026yur", "source_sha256": "5a05567f9fa7a62d7cfd3c72be7efd32e2bbe9da178307000e4ab9c1fbccd8a2", "ja": "私が伝える……。うん、ありがとうございます！\nちょっと考えすぎちゃってたみたいです。", "zh": "由我来传达……。嗯，谢谢您！\n好像是我想太多了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0623_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0623_1012_026yur", "source_sha256": "f1781ece773597b50bd225742a639806750b8a0f61df3bf2cd9f8ba84d10c17e", "ja": "本との出会いは、一期一会……！\n自分から手に取ろうと思わない本だったり……。", "zh": "与书籍相遇，正是一期一会……！\n也可能是那些自己根本不会主动拿起来读的书……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0623_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0623_1013_026yur", "source_sha256": "71079f1ca681f29ad6bee09477da5cf5a6364434fbd204a3996d908a8a130dc9", "ja": "知らなかった本との出会いを喜んでもらえるように、\n私、心を込めて読んできますね！", "zh": "为了让大家能够享受与未曾相识的书籍相遇的喜悦，\n我会用心地朗读的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
